{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4075850/extras/4db858afbdefe791688b423485794f53.poster.avif?t=1774721700\" aria-hidden=\"true\"width=654 height=368 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4075850/extras/4db858afbdefe791688b423485794f53.webm?t=1774721700\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4075850/extras/4db858afbdefe791688b423485794f53.mp4?t=1774721700\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4075850/extras/a8a51939509e11ee7bc6cd8051a5b4d4.poster.avif?t=1774721700\" aria-hidden=\"true\"width=654 height=368 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4075850/extras/a8a51939509e11ee7bc6cd8051a5b4d4.webm?t=1774721700\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4075850/extras/a8a51939509e11ee7bc6cd8051a5b4d4.mp4?t=1774721700\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4075850/extras/01276b52b9a7dd8ea6f807e905a087c4.poster.avif?t=1774721700\" aria-hidden=\"true\"width=654 height=368 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4075850/extras/01276b52b9a7dd8ea6f807e905a087c4.webm?t=1774721700\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4075850/extras/01276b52b9a7dd8ea6f807e905a087c4.mp4?t=1774721700\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A surreal combat-driven visual novel where you fight to raise your win rate in a world that constantly judges you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in fast-paced 2D first-person battles where every move matters \u2014 attack, guard, and dodge in real time to outplay your opponent.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the Weird World, your recent combat record is always visible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every encounter becomes a challenge, and every victory (or loss) shapes how others treat you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Talk to bizarre characters, make choices that influence your path, and survive in a society obsessed with winning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Real-time 2D first-person combat with reactive mechanics</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A unique system where your combat record affects interactions</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Surreal humor and unpredictable encounters</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choice-driven visual novel with multiple outcomes</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4075850?t=1774721700","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4075850/72d374b277171d7404b82c0a3c61eacc64ee46a8/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1774721700","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4075850/be6ba9a18c6289f921290d2d803f0bfa5827cbe1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774721700","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4075850/be6ba9a18c6289f921290d2d803f0bfa5827cbe1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774721700","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68